{"type":"message","id":"40a6d484","parentId":"48a34582","timestamp":"2026-03-28T04:06:32.504Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'll build the blog from scratch in the `blog/` directory. Let me create a complete single-file static blog with all requested features."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_d3ff946b0007435198ffe59e","name":"write","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/blog/index.html","content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" data-theme=\"light\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Dev Blog — Markdown with Syntax Highlighting</title>\n\n<!-- Syntax highlighting via Prism.js -->\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/prism/1.29.0/themes/prism-tomorrow.min.css\" id=\"prism-dark\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/prism/1.29.0/themes/prism.min.css\" id=\"prism-light\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/prism/1.29.0/plugins/line-numbers/prism-line-numbers.min.css\">\n<script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/prism/1.29.0/prism.min.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/prism/1.29.0/plugins/autoloader/prism-autoloader.min.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/prism/1.29.0/plugins/line-numbers/prism-line-numbers.min.js\"></script>\n\n<!-- Markdown parsing -->\n<script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/marked/12.0.1/marked.min.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/dompurify/3.1.6/purify.min.js\"></script>\n\n<style>\n/* ===== CSS Custom Properties ===== */\n:root {\n  --bg: #ffffff;\n  --bg-secondary: #f5f5f7;\n  --bg-code: #f0f0f3;\n  --text: #1d1d1f;\n  --text-secondary: #6e6e73;\n  --border: #d2d2d7;\n  --accent: #0066cc;\n  --accent-hover: #004fa3;\n  --toc-bg: #fafafa;\n  --toc-border: #e5e5ea;\n  --shadow: rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n  --radius: 8px;\n  --font-body: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;\n  --font-mono: 'SF Mono', 'Fira Code', 'Cascadia Code', Consolas, monospace;\n  --max-width: 820px;\n  --toc-width: 240px;\n  --font-size-base: clamp(1rem, 0.5vw + 0.95rem, 1.125rem);\n  --font-size-small: clamp(0.8rem, 0.4vw + 0.75rem, 0.875rem);\n  --font-size-large: clamp(1.25rem, 0.8vw + 1.1rem, 1.5rem);\n  --font-size-h1: clamp(1.75rem, 1.2vw + 1.4rem, 2.25rem);\n  --font-size-h2: clamp(1.4rem, 1vw + 1.1rem, 1.75rem);\n  --font-size-h3: clamp(1.2rem, 0.7vw + 1rem, 1.4rem);\n  --line-height: 1.7;\n}\n\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] {\n  --bg: #1a1a2e;\n  --bg-secondary: #16213e;\n  --bg-code: #0f3460;\n  --text: #e0e0e0;\n  --text-secondary: #a0a0b0;\n  --border: #2a2a4a;\n  --accent: #4da6ff;\n  --accent-hover: #80c0ff;\n  --toc-bg: #16213e;\n  --toc-border: #2a2a4a;\n  --shadow: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\n}\n\n/* ===== Reset & Base ===== */\n*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n\nhtml {\n  font-size: var(--font-size-base);\n  scroll-behavior: smooth;\n  scroll-padding-top: 80px;\n}\n\nbody {\n  font-family: var(--font-body);\n  line-height: var(--line-height);\n  color: var(--text);\n  background: var(--bg);\n  transition: background 0.3s, color 0.3s;\n  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n}\n\n/* ===== Top Bar ===== */\n.topbar {\n  position: sticky;\n  top: 0;\n  z-index: 100;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  padding: 0.6rem 1.5rem;\n  transition: background 0.3s, border 0.3s;\n}\n\n.topbar-brand {\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  text-decoration: none;\n}\n\n.topbar-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.75rem; }\n\n/* Theme toggle */\n.theme-toggle {\n  position: relative;\n  width: 52px;\n  height: 28px;\n  background: var(--bg-secondary);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 14px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.3s, border 0.3s;\n}\n\n.theme-toggle::after {\n  content: '☀️';\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 2px;\n  left: 2px;\n  width: 22px;\n  height: 22px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  transition: transform 0.3s, background 0.3s;\n  box-shadow: 0 1px 3px var(--shadow);\n}\n\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] .theme-toggle::after {\n  content: '🌙';\n  transform: translateX(24px);\n}\n\n/* File input area */\n.file-drop {\n  padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;\n  border: 1.5px dashed var(--border);\n  border-radius: var(--radius);\n  font-size: var(--font-size-small);\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: border-color 0.2s, color 0.2s;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n.file-drop:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }\n\n/* ===== Layout ===== */\n.layout {\n  display: flex;\n  max-width: calc(var(--max-width) + var(--toc-width) + 60px);\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding: 2rem 1.5rem;\n  gap: 2.5rem;\n}\n\n/* ===== TOC Sidebar ===== */\n.toc-sidebar {\n  position: sticky;\n  top: 80px;\n  width: var(--toc-width);\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  max-height: calc(100vh - 100px);\n  overflow-y: auto;\n  align-self: flex-start;\n}\n\n.toc-sidebar h2 {\n  font-size: var(--font-size-small);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n}\n\n.toc-list {\n  list-style: none;\n  border-left: 2px solid var(--border);\n  padding-left: 0;\n}\n\n.toc-list li { margin-bottom: 0.15rem; }\n\n.toc-list a {\n  display: block;\n  padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;\n  font-size: var(--font-size-small);\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  text-decoration: none;\n  border-left: 2px solid transparent;\n  margin-left: -2px;\n  transition: color 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;\n}\n\n.toc-list a:hover,\n.toc-list a.active {\n  color: var(--accent);\n  border-left-color: var(--accent);\n}\n\n.toc-list .toc-h3 { padding-left: 1.5rem; }\n\n.toc-sidebar:empty { display: none; }\n\n/* ===== Main Content ===== */\n.content { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }\n\n/* ===== Markdown Content Styles ===== */\n.md h1 { font-size: var(--font-size-h1); margin: 1.5em 0 0.5em; line-height: 1.25; }\n.md h2 { font-size: var(--font-size-h2); margin: 1.3em 0 0.4em; line-height: 1.3; }\n.md h3 { font-size: var(--font-size-h3); margin: 1.2em 0 0.4em; line-height: 1.35; }\n\n.md p { margin: 0.75em 0; }\n\n.md a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: none; }\n.md a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }\n\n.md strong { font-weight: 650; }\n.md em { font-style: italic; }\n\n.md ul, .md ol { padding-left: 1.5em; margin: 0.75em 0; }\n.md li { margin: 0.3em 0; }\n.md li > ul, .md li > ol { margin: 0.2em 0; }\n\n.md blockquote {\n  border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  padding: 0.5em 1em;\n  margin: 1em 0;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  background: var(--bg-secondary);\n  border-radius: 0 var(--radius) var(--radius) 0;\n}\n\n.md hr {\n  border: none;\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\n  margin: 2em 0;\n}\n\n.md img {\n  max-width: 100%;\n  height: auto;\n  border-radius: var(--radius);\n  margin: 1em 0;\n}\n\n/* ===== Tables ===== */\n.md table {\n  width: 100%;\n  border-collapse: collapse;\n  margin: 1em 0;\n  font-size: var(--font-size-small);\n  display: block;\n  overflow-x: auto;\n  -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\n}\n\n.md th, .md td {\n  padding: 0.6em 0.9em;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  text-align: left;\n}\n\n.md th {\n  background: var(--bg-secondary);\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n/* ===== Code ===== */\n.md code {\n  font-family: var(--font-mono);\n  font-size: 0.88em;\n}\n\n.md :not(pre) > code {\n  background: var(--bg-code);\n  padding: 0.15em 0.4em;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  color: var(--text);\n}\n\n/* Code blocks */\n.md pre {\n  border-radius: var(--radius);\n  margin: 1em 0;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  position: relative;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n}\n\n.md pre[class*=\"language-\"] {\n  margin: 1em 0;\n  border-radius: var(--radius);\n}\n\n.md pre code {\n  font-size: 0.85em;\n  line-height: 1.6;\n}\n\n/* Prism theme management */\n#prism-dark { display: none; }\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] #prism-dark { display: block; }\n[data-theme=\"dark\"] #prism-light { display: none; }\n\n/* ===== Welcome / Empty State ===== */\n.welcome {\n  text-align: center;\n  padding: 4rem 1rem;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n}\n\n.welcome h1 { font-size: var(--font-size-h1); color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 0.5em; }\n.welcome p { font-size: var(--font-size-large); margin-bottom: 1.5em; }\n\n.welcome .demo-link {\n  display: inline-block;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  text-decoration: underline;\n  margin-top: 0.5em;\n}\n\n.welcome .features {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));\n  gap: 1.25rem;\n  margin-top: 2.5rem;\n  text-align: left;\n}\n\n.welcome .feature-card {\n  background: var(--bg-secondary);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: var(--radius);\n  padding: 1.25rem;\n  transition: border-color 0.2s;\n}\n\n.welcome .feature-card:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }\n.welcome .feature-card h3 { font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 0.3em; color: var(--text); }\n.welcome .feature-card p { font-size: var(--font-size-small); margin: 0; }\n\n/* ===== Responsive ===== */\n@media (max-width: 960px) {\n  .toc-sidebar { display: none; }\n  .layout { max-width: var(--max-width); }\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 600px) {\n  .topbar { padding: 0.5rem 1rem; }\n  .layout { padding: 1.25rem 1rem; }\n  .welcome .features { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n}\n\n/* ===== Print ===== */\n@media print {\n  .topbar, .toc-sidebar { display: none; }\n  body { background: #fff; color: #000; }\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<!-- Top Bar -->\n<header class=\"topbar\">\n  <a class=\"topbar-brand\" href=\"#\">~/blog</a>\n  <div class=\"topbar-actions\">\n    <label class=\"file-drop\" for=\"md-input\">📁 Open .md file</label>\n    <input type=\"file\" id=\"md-input\" accept=\".md,.markdown,.txt\" hidden>\n    <button class=\"theme-toggle\" id=\"theme-toggle\" aria-label=\"Toggle dark/light theme\"></button>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<div class=\"layout\">\n  <!-- Table of Contents -->\n  <aside class=\"toc-sidebar\" id=\"toc-sidebar\">\n    <h2>Contents</h2>\n    <ul class=\"toc-list\" id=\"toc-list\"></ul>\n  </aside>\n\n  <!-- Main Content -->\n  <main class=\"content\" id=\"content\">\n    <div class=\"welcome\" id=\"welcome\">\n      <h1>Markdown Blog</h1>\n      <p>Drop a <code>.md</code> file to get started, or <span class=\"demo-link\" id=\"load-demo\">load the demo post</span>.</p>\n      <div class=\"features\">\n        <div class=\"feature-card\"><h3>🎨 Syntax Highlighting</h3><p>Automatic language detection for 200+ languages via Prism.js</p></div>\n        <div class=\"feature-card\"><h3>📑 Table of Contents</h3><p>Auto-generated sidebar navigation from headings</p></div>\n        <div class=\"feature-card\"><h3>🌗 Dark / Light Theme</h3><p>System-aware toggle that persists your preference</p></div>\n        <div class=\"feature-card\"><h3>📱 Responsive</h3><p>Fluid typography and layout for any screen size</p></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <article class=\"md\" id=\"md-content\" style=\"display:none\"></article>\n  </main>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n// ===== Theme Toggle =====\nconst html = document.documentElement;\nconst toggle = document.getElementById('theme-toggle');\n\nfunction setTheme(theme) {\n  html.setAttribute('data-theme', theme);\n  localStorage.setItem('blog-theme', theme);\n}\n\n// Init from saved or system preference\nconst saved = localStorage.getItem('blog-theme');\nif (saved) {\n  setTheme(saved);\n} else if (window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches) {\n  setTheme('dark');\n}\n\ntoggle.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  const next = html.getAttribute('data-theme') === 'dark' ? 'light' : 'dark';\n  setTheme(next);\n});\n\n// ===== Markdown Rendering =====\nconst mdContent = document.getElementById('md-content');\nconst welcome = document.getElementById('welcome');\nconst tocList = document.getElementById('toc-list');\nconst tocSidebar = document.getElementById('toc-sidebar');\n\n// Configure marked\nmarked.setOptions({\n  gfm: true,\n  breaks: false,\n  highlight: function(code, lang) {\n    if (Prism.languages[lang]) {\n      return Prism.highlight(code, Prism.languages[lang], lang);\n    }\n    return code;\n  }\n});\n\nlet headingId = 0;\nfunction slugify(text) {\n  return text.toLowerCase().replace(/[^\\w\\s-]/g, '').replace(/[\\s_]+/g, '-').replace(/^-+|-+$/g, '');\n}\n\nfunction renderMarkdown(md) {\n  // Custom renderer to add IDs to headings\n  const renderer = new marked.Renderer();\n  headingId = 0;\n  const headings = [];\n\n  renderer.heading = function(data) {\n    // marked v12 passes { tokens, depth, text, raw }\n    const text = data.text || this.text;\n    const depth = data.depth || this.depth;\n    const slug = slugify(text) || 'heading-' + (headingId++);\n    headings.push({ depth, text, slug });\n    return `<h${depth} id=\"${slug}\">${text}</h${depth}>`;\n  };\n\n  renderer.code = function(data) {\n    // marked v12 code renderer\n    const text = typeof data === 'object' ? (data.text || '') : data;\n    const lang = typeof data === 'object' ? (data.lang || '') : arguments[1] || '';\n    const langClass = lang ? `language-${lang}` : '';\n    const lineNumClass = lang ? 'line-numbers' : '';\n    let highlighted;\n    if (lang && Prism.languages[lang]) {\n      highlighted = Prism.highlight(text, Prism.languages[lang], lang);\n    } else {\n      highlighted = text.replace(/&/g,'&amp;').replace(/</g,'&lt;').replace(/>/g,'&gt;');\n    }\n    return `<pre class=\"${langClass} ${lineNumClass}\"><code class=\"${langClass}\">${highlighted}</code></pre>`;\n  };\n\n  marked.use({ renderer });\n\n  const rawHtml = marked.parse(md);\n  const clean = DOMPurify.sanitize(rawHtml, {\n    ADD_TAGS: ['code', 'pre', 'span'],\n    ADD_ATTR: ['class', 'id', 'data-language']\n  });\n\n  mdContent.innerHTML = clean;\n  mdContent.style.display = 'block';\n  welcome.style.display = 'none';\n\n  // Build TOC\n  tocList.innerHTML = '';\n  if (headings.length > 0) {\n    headings.forEach(h => {\n      const li = document.createElement('li');\n      const a = document.createElement('a');\n      a.href = '#' + h.slug;\n      a.textContent = h.text;\n      if (h.depth === 3) a.classList.add('toc-h3');\n      // Track active heading\n      a.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        tocList.querySelectorAll('a.active').forEach(e => e.classList.remove('active'));\n        a.classList.add('active');\n      });\n      li.appendChild(a);\n      tocList.appendChild(li);\n    });\n    tocSidebar.style.display = '';\n  } else {\n    tocSidebar.style.display = 'none';\n  }\n\n  // Highlight active heading on scroll\n  if (headings.length) {\n    const observer = new IntersectionObserver(entries => {\n      entries.forEach(entry => {\n        if (entry.isIntersecting) {\n          const id = entry.target.id;\n          tocList.querySelectorAll('a').forEach(a => {\n            a.classList.toggle('active', a.getAttribute('href') === '#' + id);\n          });\n        }\n      });\n    }, { rootMargin: '-80px 0px -60% 0px', threshold: 0 });\n\n    headings.forEach(h => {\n      const el = document.getElementById(h.slug);\n      if (el) observer.observe(el);\n    });\n  }\n}\n\n// ===== File Input =====\ndocument.getElementById('md-input').addEventListener('change', e => {\n  const file = e.target.files[0];\n  if (!file) return;\n  const reader = new FileReader();\n  reader.onload = () => renderMarkdown(reader.result);\n  reader.readAsText(file);\n  document.title = file.name.replace(/\\.\\w+$/, '') + ' — Dev Blog';\n});\n\n// ===== Demo Post =====\ndocument.getElementById('load-demo').addEventListener('click', () => {\n  document.title = 'Getting Started — Dev Blog';\n  renderMarkdown(`# Getting Started with Markdown Blog\n\nA beautiful static blog renderer that turns your **markdown** files into well-formatted posts with syntax highlighting, table of contents, and dark mode support.\n\n## Features\n\n- **Syntax Highlighting** — Powered by [Prism.js](https://prismjs.com/) with auto-detection for 200+ languages\n- **Table of Contents** — Auto-generated from your headings\n- **Dark / Light Theme** — Respects system preference, toggleable\n- **Responsive Typography** — Fluid sizing with \\`clamp()\\`\n\n## Code Examples\n\n### JavaScript\n\n\\`\\`\\`javascript\n// A simple Express server\nimport express from 'express';\n\nconst app = express();\nconst PORT = process.env.PORT || 3000;\n\napp.use(express.json());\n\napp.get('/api/posts', async (req, res) => {\n  const posts = await db.query('SELECT * FROM posts ORDER BY created_at DESC');\n  res.json({ data: posts, count: posts.length });\n});\n\napp.listen(PORT, () => {\n  console.log(\\`Server running on http://localhost:\\${PORT}\\`);\n});\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n### Python\n\n\\`\\`\\`python\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\nfrom typing import Optional\n\n@dataclass\nclass Post:\n    title: str\n    content: str\n    author: str\n    tags: list[str] = None\n    published: bool = False\n\n    def summary(self, max_length: int = 120) -> str:\n        if len(self.content) <= max_length:\n            return self.content\n        return self.content[:max_length].rsplit(' ', 1)[0] + '…'\n\npost = Post(\n    title=\"Hello World\",\n    content=\"This is my first blog post about building things.\",\n    author=\"developer\"\n)\nprint(post.summary())\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n### CSS\n\n\\`\\`\\`css\n.container {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 300px), 1fr));\n  gap: 1.5rem;\n  padding: clamp(1rem, 5vw, 3rem);\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--surface);\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  padding: 1.5rem;\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.08);\n  transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;\n}\n\n.card:hover {\n  transform: translateY(-2px);\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.12);\n}\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n### Rust\n\n\\`\\`\\`rust\nuse std::collections::HashMap;\n\nfn word_count(text: &str) -> HashMap<String, usize> {\n    let mut counts = HashMap::new();\n    for word in text.split_whitespace() {\n        let clean: String = word.chars()\n            .filter(|c| c.is_alphanumeric())\n            .flat_map(|c| c.to_lowercase())\n            .collect();\n        if !clean.is_empty() {\n            *counts.entry(clean).or_insert(0) += 1;\n        }\n    }\n    counts\n}\n\nfn main() {\n    let text = \"Hello world hello Rust\";\n    let counts = word_count(text);\n    for (word, count) in &counts {\n        println!(\"{word}: {count}\");\n    }\n}\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n## Tables\n\n| Language | Paradigm | Typing | Year |\n|----------|----------|--------|------|\n| JavaScript | Multi-paradigm | Dynamic | 1995 |\n| Python | Multi-paradigm | Dynamic | 1991 |\n| Rust | Multi-paradigm | Static | 2010 |\n| Go | Concurrent | Static | 2009 |\n| TypeScript | Multi-paradigm | Static | 2012 |\n\n## Blockquotes\n\n> \"Any fool can write code that a computer can understand. Good programmers write code that **humans** can understand.\"\n>\n> — Martin Fowler\n\n## Nested Lists\n\n1. **First**, set up your project\n   - Install dependencies\n   - Configure environment\n2. **Then**, write your content in markdown\n   - Use standard markdown syntax\n   - Include code blocks with language tags\n3. **Finally**, build and deploy\n   - Static hosting works great\n   - No server required\n\n## Inline Code\n\nUse \\`git init\\` to start a repo, \\`npm run build\\` to compile, and \\`rsync\\` to deploy. It's that simple.\n\n---\n\n*Built with ❤️ using vanilla HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.*\n`);\n});\n\n// ===== Drag & Drop =====\ndocument.body.addEventListener('dragover', e => { e.preventDefault(); });\ndocument.body.addEventListener('drop', e => {\n  e.preventDefault();\n  const file = e.dataTransfer.files[0];\n  if (file && /\\.(md|markdown|txt)$/i.test(file.name)) {\n    const reader = new FileReader();\n    reader.onload = () => renderMarkdown(reader.result);\n    reader.readAsText(file);\n    document.title = file.name.replace(/\\.\\w+$/, '') + ' — Dev Blog';\n  }\n});\n\n// ===== URL hash loading =====\nif (location.hash) {\n  setTimeout(() => {\n    const el = document.querySelector(location.hash);\n    if (el) el.scrollIntoView();\n  }, 100);\n}\n</script>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5-turbo","usage":{"input":49,"output":5730,"cacheRead":14719,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20498,"cost":{"input":0.0000588,"output":0.02292,"cacheRead":0.0035325599999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02651136}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774670742706,"responseId":"20260328120543b7228c00c9d14345"}}
